Answer: No, the search result does not indicate that the FBI issued any official statement or court filing confirming its possession of Hunter Biden's laptop prior to October 22, 2020. While documents obtained by Fox News suggest the FBI subpoenaed a laptop and hard drive in connection with a money laundering investigation in late 2019, the FBI itself "declined to confirm or deny whether an investigation was taking place."

Source URL: https://news.yahoo.com/hunter-biden-purported-laptop-connected-120252142.html

